---
title: Nick's Favorite Oyster Crackers
source: Grandma Schwennesen
---

In a #gallon bag{} place @vegetable oil{0.25%cup}, @powdered ranch dressing{2%tbsp}, and @oyster crackers{1%package}.

Shake until all crackers are coated.

Dump onto a #cookie sheet{} and bake at 250 F for ~{15-20%minutes}.
